{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港道教聯合會，在粉嶺蓬瀛仙館設立宏福苑火災周年祈福追思道場，開放予公眾致祭。</p><p><br/>道場早上舉行追思儀式，聯合會表示希望藉設立追思道場，超度亡靈，禳除火厄，撫慰受火災影響市民的心靈，並祈願香港社會團結和諧。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:16:38.993392+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T00:57:13.486846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:09:51.872370+00:00","content_hash":"f3f4ad3214b3370d4b73be583624afd47a8f6bd2b3b943ab19befe0570921d57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:16:38.993392+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}